# Desktop (single-machine) build of the web app — loaded by
# `vite build --mode desktop`, i.e. `npm run build:desktop` in `web/`.
#
# As of 1.3.3 the desktop artifact is the *same* app as the server build: the flag
# below no longer swaps any module out (the change-password card is no longer
# stripped) — it only picks the output directory, `web/dist-desktop`
# (see `web/vite.config.ts`). `web/src/lib/platform.ts` still exposes it as
# `IS_DESKTOP_TARGET` for target detection.
VITE_SCREENPLAY_TARGET=desktop